#

# The house vocabulary: one word per line, case-insensitive, for words that
# neither cspell's en-GB and en dictionaries nor its software dictionaries
# know. Vim reads the same format, and the name, `en.utf-8.add`, is what a
# Neovim `spellfile` requires, so Neovim can check against it too.
